# FryPDF Font Resources — Open Source License Notice

The fonts contained in this repository are distributed under free, open-source licenses permitting personal and commercial use, embedding, bundling, and redistribution.

---

## License Summary

### 1. SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1 (OFL 1.1)
The vast majority of fonts in this repository (64 fonts, including Google Noto Sans multilingual families, Inter, Poppins, Montserrat, Raleway, Lato, Fira Code, Caveat, Orbitron, Oswald, etc.) are released under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.

Full license text is available in [`OFL.txt`](./OFL.txt) and at https://scripts.sil.org/OFL.

### 2. Apache License, Version 2.0
The following fonts designed by Christian Robertson for Google LLC are released under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
- `fonts/Roboto.ttf`
- `fonts/RobotoMono.ttf`

Full license text is available in [`LICENSE-Apache-2.0.txt`](./LICENSE-Apache-2.0.txt) and at http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.

### 3. Ubuntu Font Licence, Version 1.0
The following font designed by Dalton Maag for Canonical Ltd is released under the Ubuntu Font Licence, Version 1.0:
- `fonts/Ubuntu.ttf`

Full license text is available in [`LICENSE-Ubuntu.txt`](./LICENSE-Ubuntu.txt) and at https://ubuntu.com/legal/font-licence.

---

